{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And I will put enmity.</b> That the imaginative faculty shall be abhorrent in its eyes — even its own — as the Sages said: אִשָּׁה חֵמֶת מָלֵא צוֹאָה וּפִיהָ מָלֵא דָם (Shabbat 152a). And this applies alike to male and female." "<b>And between your seed and between her seed.</b> This will not be between Adam and Eve alone." "<b>He shall bruise your head.</b> The imaginative faculty will diminish the pleasure at the onset of its attainment, by imagining and devising fear of harm in the quality, quantity, and order of the pleasure." "<b>And you shall bruise his heel.</b> For the one who intensifies his desire will produce harm at the end of the pleasure."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:54.356265454Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}